# Private keys, never. A stray `ssh-keygen` in game/ left an OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY sitting
# untracked and unignored on 2026-08-31 — one `git add -A` from a public remote, with
# several sessions committing to this repo. Patterns, not filenames, because the accident
# names the file after whatever the shell mangled.
*.pem
*.key
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
*OPENSSH*
ssh-keygen*
